Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.05,0:00:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Challenging\Neverybody and\Nutilizing and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.08,0:00:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,living to the\Nmaximum potential
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.12,0:00:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,that we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.45,0:00:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,These are the\Nlessons that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.42,0:00:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I've learned from my\Nmentors,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.38,0:00:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,from my teachers,\Nfrom the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.35,0:00:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,books, from my\Nexperiences and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.32,0:00:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,the guests who have\Nbeen
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.28,0:00:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,on my podcast.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.85,0:00:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,So jitna bhi\Nmediocrity, average
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.25,0:00:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,life jo sab humne\Njiya
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.65,0:00:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,hai, that's all\Npast.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.05,0:00:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,This year is about\Ninstant
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.63,0:00:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,clarity, focus and\Nliving to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.20,0:00:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,the maximum\Npotential that we
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.77,0:00:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,have.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.35,0:00:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Write down the\Nthings.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.30,0:00:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,things that I talk\Nabout
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.26,0:00:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,because I made my\Nteam
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.28,0:00:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,do the same thing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.66,0:00:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,and I actually do it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.71,0:00:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,myself which has\Nreally helped
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.75,0:00:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,me in my life.
